  "body": "## Summary\n- Writes modal G94 in the preamble of the Sinumerik 840D post (^Gssets/posts/sinumerik.cps).\n- Updates Sinumerik 810M tapping note to state that rigid tapping requires an encoder and L84 requires a compensating holder.\n- Updates all Sinumerik golden NC test files and test suites to reflect modal G94 in preamble blocks.\n\n## Verification\n- cargo test -p camcraft-post --test arc_planes --test explain_remaining --test probe_dialects --test wcs_flip_dialects (all passed)\n- cargo test -p camcraft-app --test control_comp --test program_units --test setup_mount_trace --test sinumerik_work_offsets --test wear_comp (all passed)\n- cargo clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings (clean)\n\n## Goldens moved\nAll 31 changed NC files add G94 after G90 in the preamble opening block (e.g. \\N10 G17 G710 G90 G94 G54 G40 G80\\):\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/inch/sinumerik/contour_plate_with_hole.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/inch/sinumerik/drill_peck.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/arc_planes.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/contour_control_comp.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/contour_disc_hole.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/contour_plate_with_hole.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/contour_tangential_lead.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/contour_wear_comp.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/drill_peck.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/drill_plate.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/face_square_40x40.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/face_square_40x40_stepped.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/pocket_waterline_plate_with_island.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/probe_bore_centre.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/slot_fullwidth_centerline.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/slot_wide_channel_rows.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/tap_plate.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik/trace_plate_with_hole.nc\\\n- \\crates/app/tests/golden/nc/synth_sinumerik.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/golden/bore/sinumerik.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/golden/explain/sinumerik.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/golden/ream/sinumerik.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/golden/wcs_flip/sinumerik_x.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik/arcs.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik/drill_retract.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik/empty_section.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik/extreme_coords.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik/full_circle.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik/full_circle_raw.nc\\\n- \\crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik/probe.nc\\\n\nChangelog: Sinumerik post: write modal G94 in opening block preamble\n\nFixes #4150",
